text: ['({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "As long as you control a Yanling planeswalker, Moon-Eating Dog has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Breath of Fire deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'Cleansing Screech deals 4 damage to any target.', "Dragon's Presence deals 5 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.", 'Draw three cards.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWelkin Tern can block only creatures with flying.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhenever Fire-Omen Crane attacks, it deals 1 damage to target creature an opponent controls.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhenever Heavenly Qilin attacks, another target creature you control gains flying until end of turn.", 'Flying\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control attack, you gain 1 life for each attacking creature.', 'Flying\\n{2}{R}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Meandering River enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Return up to two target creatures to their owner's hand.\\nSearch your library and/or graveyard for a card named Mu Yanling, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you searched your library this way, shuffle.", 'Search your library and graveyard for a basic land card and a card named Jiang Yanggu, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Target creature gets +4/+4 and gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.", 'Timber Gorge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Vivid Flying Fish has flying as long as it's attacking. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'When Earth-Origin Yak enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Purple-Crystal Crab dies, draw a card.', 'Whenever Nine-Tail White Fox deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', 'Whenever Reckless Pangolin attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "[+1]: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\n[−1]: If you don't control a creature named Mowu, create Mowu, a legendary 3/3 green Dog creature token.\\n[−5]: Until end of turn, target creature gains trample and gets +X/+X, where X is the number of lands you control.", "[+2]: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.\\n[−3]: Draw two cards.\\n[−10]: Tap all creatures your opponents control. You take an extra turn after this one.", '{3}{G}, {T}: You gain 4 life. Activate only if you control a Yanggu planeswalker.']
flavor: ['"A pangolin\'s power grows with its speed. Strike when you have the chance!"\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"As my hands touched it, I realized that I had not found it—it had been leading me here."', '"Crackle" and "pop" are the most wondrous sounds.', '"For reasons unknown to me, herds in the Arrow Bamboo Forest have become more and more agitated."\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"From the swallows, I learned how to ride the winds to anywhere, and from my tears, I mastered how to harness the water."', '"Interesting . . . This mortal being seems to have been blessed with Qilin\'s essence."\\n—Mu Yanling\'s journal', '"Mowu was wary that day, as though he sensed the danger ahead."\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', '"Prepare for battle!"\\n—Jiang Yanggu', '"The Ancestor Dragon appeared atop the clouds, amid shattering mountains and sundering earth."\\n—Jiang Yanggu\'s travelogue', 'A heaven-sent vision is like a lantern to guide the way.', "A pangolin's scales are resistant to all sorts of damage and weaponry. Desire for them threatens to drive the pangolin to extinction.", 'A precious shell without, a delicious taste within.', 'Clouds and mists cover the lake as though it were a dreamland. When the wind rises, the mists disperse, opening great vistas of rippling reeds.', 'Deep in the Northern Mountains, the yaks linger silently, channeling the powers of the earth.', 'Fire leads to more fire.', "If you can see it clearly, you're already on fire.", 'It has waited a millennium just for you, and for a millennium will it watch over your descendants.', 'It is said that Yinglong gave birth to the qilin and the phoenix, and after them, all the hairy and winged beings in the world. Thus it is known as the Ancestor Dragon.', 'It stops flying only as its life comes to an end.', 'It strides through the universe as though stepping on the stars, crossing freely between the celestial and earthly worlds.', 'Its wings are a heavenly inferno that sets the world ablaze.', 'Known for their glowing horn and stone-rattling roar, zheng are the fiercest predators in the forest. Few survived before Jiang Yanggu came.', 'Mystery lies beneath the haunting mists. Never stay where obscurity deepens.', 'Near the Western Seas lies Mount Zhaoyao—a forest of stones that reaches the clouds, a bountiful land of wondrous treasures and strange animals.', 'Not all enormous beasts are quick to anger.', 'The most nimble of creatures, it chases the most sacred luminence.', 'The pale deer are believed to have lived a thousand years, the pure white five hundred more. Those who seek them would gladly wander the wilds forever for the merest glimpse of these sacred beings.', "The rainbow seen above the Great Lake of Cloud Dream just after the rain is nothing but the vivid-colored flying fishes' ritual dance.", 'The spirits of all the rivers and oceans came together as an unstoppable force, unleashing their fury as lightning and thunder.', 'The welcoming appearance of the Arrow Bamboo Forest masks its deathly hostility.', 'These nimble sparrows, not often seen, delight in tricking the pangolins that wander the forest.', 'This strange beast has the hide of a leopard, the howl of a dog, and the horns of an ox.', 'Two bodies, twice the malice.']
